'''''Vanda tricolor''''' is a species of [[orchid]] occurring in [[Laos]] and from [[Java]], [[Bali]], [[Lombok]] and [[Sumbawa]]. It was imported to England by [[Thomas Lobb]], the collector for Veitch Nurseries, from the western part of Java in 1846.<ref>James H. Veitch, Hortus Veitchii (1906), 157</ref>

